    <item>
      <title>大模型“宫斗”大戏上演：DeepSeek怒删豆包，Kimi玩世不恭，AI圈儿到底谁最“茶”？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/deepseekkimiai-20250821201004617-0/</link>
